This report follows the seven-step credibility assessment framework set out in
FDA's January 2025 draft guidance *Considerations for the Use of Artificial
Intelligence to Support Regulatory Decision-Making for Drug and Biological
Products*. **That guidance is a draft and has not been finalised.** The framework
is applied here because it is a defensible way to structure the argument, not
because compliance with it is currently required. The final standards this
package is built against are stated in the validation plan.

